{# demo_label: the source-link filename shown in an embed's tab bar.  Origins are kept
   DISTINCT so a demo can't be mistaken for a plugin and vice-versa -- neither reads as a
   bare `cmk/…`:
     * `.cmk/…` plugin (the `.cmk` submodule) -> keep the full `.cmk/…` path, so it reads as
       the plugin it is (without this a plugin collapsed to a bare basename and lost origin).
     * `demos/cmk/…` cmk-twin demo -> drop the whole `demos/cmk/` prefix (the `.cmk`
       *extension* already marks it as cmk-lang, so a `cmk/` prefix is both redundant and
       collides with the `.cmk` plugin namespace).  So `demos/cmk/foo.cmk` -> `foo.cmk`.
     * other `demos/…` -> the demos-relative path (so deep demos read as e.g.
       `tui/extension-1.mk` rather than a bare `extension-1.mk`).
     * anything else -> the basename. #}
{% macro demo_label(fname)-%}{{ fname if fname.startswith('.cmk/') else (fname[10:] if fname.startswith('demos/cmk/') else (fname[6:] if fname.startswith('demos/') else fname.split('/')|last)) }}{%- endmacro -%}

